<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Applicant Approved — KSK Admin</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('partials/sidebar', { active: 'applications' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <div class="admin-topbar"><h1>Admin Account Created</h1></div>
    <div class="panel" style="max-width:480px;">
      <p><strong><%= name %></strong> now has an active admin account.</p>
      <p>Share these temporary login details with them securely (phone call, in person, WhatsApp — not a public channel). This password is shown <strong>only once</strong>.</p>
      <table class="admin-table">
        <tr><th>Email</th><td><%= email %></td></tr>
        <tr><th>Temporary password</th><td><code><%= tempPassword %></code></td></tr>
      </table>
      <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;margin-top:14px;">They should log in at <code>/admin/login</code>. Consider adding a "change password" feature next so they can set their own.</p>
      <a href="/admin/applications" class="btn primary" style="margin-top:8px;">Back to applications</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
